Flower Jar was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with a Dust that would add a random [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Plant Plant] to your hand. '''Beta 39.1''' nerfed that by making it just add a Red Flower to your hand instead, a 5/5/5 effectless Plant added as a generated monster in the same update. '''Beta 57.0''' buffed it by giving it +1 ATK.

